### PHPUnit declares --testsuite as initial-run-only

Source: https://github.com/infection/infection/blob/master/src/TestFramework/PhpUnit/Adapter/PhpUnitAdapter.php

The PHPUnit adapter explicitly lists --testsuite as an option that should only be passed to the initial run, not to mutant runs.

```php
public function getInitialRunOnlyOptions(): array
{
    return ['--configuration', '--filter', '--testsuite'];
}
